The basic equations relating spherical coordinates to both cylindrical and Cartesian coordinates are as follows: 
	

	Spherical/cylindrical: 			

		{ r = p sinφ			{ p² = r² + z²
		{ θ = Θ				{ tan φ = r/z
		{ z = p cosφ			{ θ = Θ


	Spherical/Cartesian: 

		{ x = p sinφ cosθ		{ p² = x² + y² + z²
		{ y = p sinφ sinθ		{ tanφ = √(x² + y²/z)
		{ z = p cosφ   			{ tanΘ = Θ

